HELP.md

# Output of Maven. Every folder with this name holds build output, also a
# folder under src/. A build output must never reach the repository: the first
# version of this file took the folder src/main/docker/target back into the
# repository, and a JAR of 27 MB went into the history with it.
target/
*.jar.original
!.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.jar

